Actually, I think the two most interesting "self-imposed constraints to make
nethack more difficult" were:

1. Weaponless.  Some have said that winning without an artifact is hard...try
killing the Wizard and all his pets with nothing but your feet.  I nearly made
it with a priest in 3.0...unfortunately, I got swallowed by a purple worm.
Couldn't kick free, so I reached into my BoH for a wand of digging...but Wiz
had cursed the bag.  No wand.  Not enough Amulets. No ascension.

2. Vegetarian.  No eating corpses of any sort.  I suspect this would be easier
in 3.1 now that it is possible to get some intrinsics by eating rings...

